### rev

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl rev s =\n    (StreamNil, s)\n    ||> fold fun s x =>\n        StreamCons (x, fun () => s)","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

