### try_item

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl try_item i s =\n    inl rec body forall a {number} b. (i : a) : stream b -> option b = function\n        | StreamCons (x, _) when i <= 0 => Some x\n        | StreamCons (_, fn) => 루프 (i - 1) (fn ())\n        | StreamNil => None\n    and inl 루프 forall a {number} b. (acc : a) (s' : stream b) : option b =\n        match var_is acc, var_is s' with\n        | false, false => body acc s'\n        | _ =>\n            inl acc = dyn acc\n            inl s' = dyn s'\n            join body acc s'\n    루프 i s\n\ninl item i =\n    try_item i >> optionm.value","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl try_item i s =
      inl rec body forall a {number} b. (i : a) : stream b -> option b = function
          | StreamCons (x, _) when i <= 0 => Some x
          | StreamCons (_, fn) => 루프 (i - 1) (fn ())
          | StreamNil => None
      and inl 루프 forall a {number} b. (acc : a) (s' : stream b) : option b =
          match var_is acc, var_is s' with
          | false, false => body acc s'
          | _ =>
              inl acc = dyn acc
              inl s' = dyn s'
              join body acc s'
      루프 i s

  inl item i =
      try_item i >> optionm.value
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n\nlistm.init 10i32 id\n|> from_list\n|> item 9i32\n|> _assert_eq 9","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
