### zip

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl zip s1 s2 =\n    zip_with pair s1 s2\n\ninl zip_ s1 s2 =\n    zip_with_ pair s1 s2","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl zip s1 s2 =
      zip_with pair s1 s2

  inl zip_ s1 s2 =
      zip_with_ pair s1 s2
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

