### unzip

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl unzip s =\n    inl rec body forall a b. (s : stream (a * b)) : stream a * stream b =\n        match s with\n        | StreamCons ((x, y), fn) =>\n            inl xs, ys = 루프 (fn ())\n            StreamCons (x, fun () => xs), StreamCons (y, fun () => ys)\n        | StreamNil => pair StreamNil StreamNil\n    and inl 루프 forall a b. (x : stream (a * b)) : stream a * stream b =\n        if var_is x |> not\n        then body x\n        else\n            inl x = dyn x\n            join body x\n    루프 s","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl unzip s =
      inl rec body forall a b. (s : stream (a * b)) : stream a * stream b =
          match s with
          | StreamCons ((x, y), fn) =>
              inl xs, ys = 루프 (fn ())
              StreamCons (x, fun () => xs), StreamCons (y, fun () => ys)
          | StreamNil => pair StreamNil StreamNil
      and inl 루프 forall a b. (x : stream (a * b)) : stream a * stream b =
          if var_is x |> not
          then body x
          else
              inl x = dyn x
              join body x
      루프 s
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n\nlistm.init 10i32 id\n|> listm.map (fun x => x, x)\n|> from_list\n|> unzip\n|> fun x, y =>\n    x |> sum\n    |> _assert_eq 45\n\n    y |> sum\n    |> _assert_eq 45","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

